97031e80c9810881a3"},"message":"db: use PolicyManager for RequestTags migration\n\nRefactor the RequestTags migration (202601121700-migrate-hostinfo-request-tags)\nto use PolicyManager.NodeCanHaveTag() instead of reimplementing tag validation.\n\nChanges:\n- NewHeadscaleDatabase now accepts *types.Config to allow migrations\n  access to policy configuration\n- Add loadPolicyBytes helper to load policy from file or DB based on config\n- Add standalone GetPolicy(tx *gorm.DB) for use during migrations\n- Replace custom tag validation logic with PolicyManager\n\nBenefits:\n- Full HuJSON parsing support (not just JSON)\n- Proper group expansion via PolicyManager\n- Support for nested tags and autogroups\n- Works with both file and database policy modes\n- Single source of truth for tag validation\n\nUpdates #3006","parents":[{"sha":"740f650a4d6e41994109eb9f2d8e65d2139ab12b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/740f650a4d6e41994109eb9f2d8e65d2139ab12b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/740f650a4d6e41994109eb9f2d8e65d2139ab12b"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"96ccacaae2af73f4719ef0fa8f21256a6b59b03a","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDk2Y2NhY2FhZTJhZjczZjQ3MTllZjBmYThmMjEyNTZhNmI1OWIwM2E","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/96ccacaae2af73f4719ef0fa8f21256a6b59b03a","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/96ccacaae2af73f4719ef0fa8f21256a6b59b03a","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-21T10:52:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-21T11:33:49Z"},"tree":{"sha":"8762ba41af674c0801707a4d3036928bd464bd60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/8762ba41af674c0801707a4d3036928bd464bd60"},"message":"db: remove unused KV struct\n\nThe KV struct was marked as \"For future use\" with a TODO asking if it's\nused anywhere. It was never used and can be safely removed.","parents":[{"sha":"3bf01d4cee572b5387ab0caba4a88f2057ce7b1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3bf01d4cee572b5387ab0caba4a88f2057ce7b1c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3bf01d4cee572b5387ab0caba4a88f2057ce7b1c"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"ecb4b488bab1fd313ec26b88282bdfe6ad6752be","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGVjYjRiNDg4YmFiMWZkMzEzZWMyNmI4ODI4MmJkZmU2YWQ2NzUyYmU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/ecb4b488bab1fd313ec26b88282bdfe6ad6752be","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/ecb4b488bab1fd313ec26b88282bdfe6ad6752be","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-21T10:56:33Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-21T11:33:49Z"},"tree":{"sha":"81e92c353c488f555d09c3bc7980c44f7d83c562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/81e92c353c488f555d09c3bc7980c44f7d83c562"},"message":"db: add tests for RequestTags migration\n\nAdd comprehensive test coverage for the RequestTags migration\n(202601121700-migrate-hostinfo-request-tags) and forced_tags->tags\nrename migration (202511131445-node-forced-tags-to-tags).\n\nTest scenarios:\n- Authorized RequestTags are migrated to tags column\n- Unauthorized RequestTags are rejected\n- Existing tags are preserved when merging new tags\n- No duplicate tags when RequestTag matches existing tag\n- Nodes without RequestTags are unchanged\n- Group membership is evaluated for tag authorization\n- Mixed authorized/unauthorized tags are handled correctly\n\nUpdates #3006","parents":[{"sha":"96ccacaae2af73f4719ef0fa8f21256a6b59b03a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/96ccacaae2af73f4719ef0fa8f21256